ial sciences will be essential for addressing the complex challenges of trustworthy AI in practice.\n\n## References\n\n[1] K. He, X. Zhang, S. Ren, and J. Sun, \"Deep Residual Learning for Image Recognition,\" *arXiv preprint arXiv:1512.03385*, 2015.\n\n[2] B. Wang, W. Chen, H. Pei, et al., \"DecodingTrust: A Comprehensive Assessment of Trustworthiness in GPT Models,\" *arXiv preprint arXiv:2306.11698*, 2023.\n\n[3] C. Guo, C. Xie, Y. Yang, et al., \"RedCodeAgent: Automatic Red-teaming Agent against Diverse Code Agents,\" *arXiv preprint arXiv:2510.02609*, 2025.\n",
